+4. J-3: add the skip / update / add-anyway decision to the duplicate panel (imports lane, no money).
+5. J-4: fix the false `.xls` claim (accept list + help text) — smallest honest fix.
+6. J-7: build the attachment list filters/preview on the existing `documents` collection (read-only list
+   work; removal already goes through the server).
+7. Produce `audit/agent11/FINAL_ACCURATE_LIST_2026-11-10.md` with every item re-verified at this commit.
+8. Commit + push + Drive snapshot after each milestone; keep this checkpoint updated.
+
